  "intro": {
    "title": "Alles klar?",
    "paragraphs": [
      "You'll hear alles klar a dozen times a day: everything clear, all good. The word is all-, and its ending tells you what it refers to: alle for people or plural things, alles for 'everything'."
    ]
  },
